                "metadata": {
                    "category": "podcast",
                    "description": "Mary Farfisa is a cheerful eight-year-old space-girl. Mary searches the Galaxies for 'songs and sounds and music and noise\" to share with the Universe! Mary is an audio wrangler—she's able to catch lost sounds from the past in her audio lasso. Accompanied by her space-horse, Briscoe, Mary finds music and friendship in Outer Space. A sci-fi-musical-comedy-adventure, written & produced by Jim Cheff.",
